<node id="[ORGANIZATION] DHS">
  <data key="d0">[ORGANIZATION] DHS</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Department of Homeland Security (DHS) is a federal organization tasked with various security and enforcement operations. 

In specific operational contexts, Department of Homeland Security agents and personnel have been involved in raids and protests. During these deployments, DHS personnel have been documented utilizing a variety of tactical equipment, including compressed air launchers, smoke grenades—specifically during incidents in Minnesota—and PepperBall guns.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3ba6044269b8dd10ab25c05ea471e947&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-598ab38354c1c57cfa72acf1b3d3aa3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cba89918434092130fbfcd87a7a7a4d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31a06cf7ccdb26fd20a38348a67a66e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b912941ec62704454d7a4f6ea0a43c24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c355d6ad3168c8541938edacef73db2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-528d792138baa043a098b55be76593b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0be230485af952dad48ebfd858e152b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01b7723ae953bf130422ee19615d0a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-452ea0db42b7631cfe71bfe396adcd0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e391d49ad1a5cbcdfbe5489080420dd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-989afbffe5b91ac7cd0290e0dcf9f37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab3c23dc96eb032c4cf34a6c4dd9a23b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e88518d6859e408eed3931911f349632&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87ca45c76499d3c98272200fa6ea4e7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31e0d82f3c8dd8bab2a9bd241ca5125d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-135dd9fb97837e61fde5461feedbba67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8b0680bbf08daadbeefe30d6bf9e9a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef4a9dfa58d2b0d2772a3238fc5b8108&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-033eff3da049499c50400c71bf5b6058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58b830b38791cbe8b20eb03d5c9eb251&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ee1a0fa15ce1a4282b12b0df7b1bf39</data>
  <data key="d4">raw/82e11604-60b7-410a-a0c3-4037e59b4796.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;raw/71151b33-9bc5-49eb-baf6-0d1494a8043d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;raw/ec2b6645-9847-4c98-8ae8-3e14ee0c97fc.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;raw/39b5e294-cadd-481b-9498-670b6e3121d4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;raw/8c786cd1-aaf0-4b14-bff3-89560b40f36e.pdf</data>
