<node id="[ORGANIZATION] Border Patrol">
  <data key="d0">[ORGANIZATION] Border Patrol</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Border Patrol is a federal law enforcement and immigration enforcement agency. The organization conducts operations across various locations, including Bakersfield and Chicago, and is responsible for managing immigration surges.

The agency has been associated with several use-of-force incidents involving its agents. Specifically, the Border Patrol is identified as the agency responsible for the killing of Alex Pretti and the employment of agents who used force. In one such instance, an officer identified as EZ-17 utilized a less-lethal launcher.

Additionally, the organization's leadership structure has included the role of Commander at Large, a position previously held by Bovino.&lt;SEP&gt;Agency that arrested Isabel Mata and Dayanne Figueroa.&lt;SEP&gt;Agency whose agents were seen using launchers during clashes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3ba6044269b8dd10ab25c05ea471e947&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fa9f82f8e577c2a95faf40eb71d330d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cd87f2d79c6c5c695102b3e8ebb9af7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8f0e5ea764556ba7aba3f8e5f4f3ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cba89918434092130fbfcd87a7a7a4d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31a06cf7ccdb26fd20a38348a67a66e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-528d792138baa043a098b55be76593b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0be230485af952dad48ebfd858e152b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87ca45c76499d3c98272200fa6ea4e7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb30c633d5049dcab722f2ef0da09357</data>
  <data key="d4">raw/82e11604-60b7-410a-a0c3-4037e59b4796.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;raw/71151b33-9bc5-49eb-baf6-0d1494a8043d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;raw/39b5e294-cadd-481b-9498-670b6e3121d4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;raw/8c786cd1-aaf0-4b14-bff3-89560b40f36e.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1780570395</data>
</node>
