<node id="[LOCATION] Chicago">
  <data key="d0">[LOCATION] Chicago</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Chicago is the city where a series of protests and legal proceedings took place, including an injunction hearing and the issuance of a Temporary Restraining Order (TRO) by a federal judge. During these events, protesters blocked vehicles, and various use-of-force incidents occurred, including a traffic incident and confrontations instigated by Bovino.

Within the city, federal agents employed force and tear gas, and incidents involving the use of pepper spray were reported, including a specific instance where Hewson sprayed an individual. Additionally, Chicago is the city where the Old Irving Park neighbourhood is located.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3ba6044269b8dd10ab25c05ea471e947&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-598ab38354c1c57cfa72acf1b3d3aa3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fa9f82f8e577c2a95faf40eb71d330d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8698953f32fa1e034a49c9bfb64ca65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d45ca0699542b947318572c00e10851&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8f0e5ea764556ba7aba3f8e5f4f3ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01b7723ae953bf130422ee19615d0a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6a73f6c7351e7d12ae6e6090f3e8da9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-989afbffe5b91ac7cd0290e0dcf9f37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf3b9eec46720c6dc296e97815683ad3</data>
  <data key="d4">raw/82e11604-60b7-410a-a0c3-4037e59b4796.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;raw/ec2b6645-9847-4c98-8ae8-3e14ee0c97fc.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;raw/39b5e294-cadd-481b-9498-670b6e3121d4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1780569617</data>
</node>
<node id="[ORGANIZATION] Bellingcat">
  <data key="d0">[ORGANIZATION] Bellingcat</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Bellingcat is a non-profit, collaborating investigative organization that specializes in conflict research and conducting detailed inquiries through the analysis of documents and footage. The organization is widely recognized for its rigorous verification processes used to corroborate identities and for publishing investigations into brutality and the activities of various agents.

In its operational capacity, Bellingcat conducts detailed reviews of incident footage and social media videos, specifically regarding the deployment and use of riot control weapons. This includes a 2021 analysis of less-lethal munitions and broader analysis on munitions and civilian harm. To enhance the clarity of its findings, the organization provides detailed annotations and zoomed-in views of scenes. Through these efforts, Bellingcat successfully corroborated the identifications of EZ-1 and EZ-2 and verified the social media account of Donahue.

As part of its investigative activities, Bellingcat has published reports, requested policies, and jointly sought contact with the Department of Homeland Security (DHS) to question them. Additionally, the organization has collaborated with contributors such as Justin Baird, who produced graphics for their work.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3ba6044269b8dd10ab25c05ea471e947&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-598ab38354c1c57cfa72acf1b3d3aa3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fa9f82f8e577c2a95faf40eb71d330d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8698953f32fa1e034a49c9bfb64ca65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d45ca0699542b947318572c00e10851&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9cd87f2d79c6c5c695102b3e8ebb9af7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8f0e5ea764556ba7aba3f8e5f4f3ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cba89918434092130fbfcd87a7a7a4d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31a06cf7ccdb26fd20a38348a67a66e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b912941ec62704454d7a4f6ea0a43c24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c355d6ad3168c8541938edacef73db2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da4a4d3c6ea14f387f993aedce4ed752&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afec13b58ac09eba645258028762d519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-528d792138baa043a098b55be76593b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0be230485af952dad48ebfd858e152b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180af3952c4d75447a2acd11a8bca48a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6a73f6c7351e7d12ae6e6090f3e8da9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44de13747f538fd5aea71e9f9f17af12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e391d49ad1a5cbcdfbe5489080420dd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-989afbffe5b91ac7cd0290e0dcf9f37e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cff84815afd023d8e8bbca3290354599&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c62092979a3f2ca6e48f697d46cc52ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a8efc1fd3d7ac1fc9bccad7f9f5d144&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf3b9eec46720c6dc296e97815683ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e88518d6859e408eed3931911f349632&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87ca45c76499d3c98272200fa6ea4e7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9105d4bba19aade035da9b3a25e5ca4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb30c633d5049dcab722f2ef0da09357&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31e0d82f3c8dd8bab2a9bd241ca5125d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-135dd9fb97837e61fde5461feedbba67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef4a9dfa58d2b0d2772a3238fc5b8108&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-033eff3da049499c50400c71bf5b6058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df00c56f336c81374b54c428982985f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58b830b38791cbe8b20eb03d5c9eb251</data>
  <data key="d4">raw/82e11604-60b7-410a-a0c3-4037e59b4796.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;raw/71151b33-9bc5-49eb-baf6-0d1494a8043d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;raw/39b5e294-cadd-481b-9498-670b6e3121d4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;raw/8c786cd1-aaf0-4b14-bff3-89560b40f36e.pdf</data>
