<node id="[PERSON] EZ-17">
  <data key="d0">[PERSON] EZ-17</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">EZ-17 is a Customs and Border Protection (CBP) agent and a member of the Border Patrol Tactical Division (BORTAC), identified as Edgar Vazquez. He is recognized by the uniform number patch EZ-17.

Agent Edgar Vazquez was involved in raids and shooting incidents, during which he fired multiple shots at protesters. During these events, he utilized a B&amp;T GL06 and carried a SKAT Shell.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-598ab38354c1c57cfa72acf1b3d3aa3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b912941ec62704454d7a4f6ea0a43c24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c355d6ad3168c8541938edacef73db2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da4a4d3c6ea14f387f993aedce4ed752&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afec13b58ac09eba645258028762d519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4333b56c71504cc5db99aeb9b9a3462&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-528d792138baa043a098b55be76593b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-180af3952c4d75447a2acd11a8bca48a</data>
