<node id="[LOCATION] Minneapolis">
  <data key="d0">[LOCATION] Minneapolis</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Minneapolis is a city that experienced a series of violent incidents and civil unrest in early 2026. The city was the site of a fatal shooting incident involving Renee Good, which subsequently triggered widespread protests and further shootings. During these events, a Customs and Border Protection (CBP) shooting occurred, and the city saw a surge in Border Patrol presence.

The unrest in Minneapolis was characterized by widespread use-of-force incidents. Evidence of these clashes includes the discovery of a used Riot Control CS Grenade on January 23, 2026. Additionally, individuals identified as Hewson and Bovino were observed within the city during this period.&lt;SEP&gt;City where USBP agent fired powder blast dispersion rounds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-598ab38354c1c57cfa72acf1b3d3aa3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fa9f82f8e577c2a95faf40eb71d330d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8698953f32fa1e034a49c9bfb64ca65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e8f0e5ea764556ba7aba3f8e5f4f3ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31a06cf7ccdb26fd20a38348a67a66e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-528d792138baa043a098b55be76593b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0be230485af952dad48ebfd858e152b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31e0d82f3c8dd8bab2a9bd241ca5125d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-033eff3da049499c50400c71bf5b6058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df00c56f336c81374b54c428982985f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc81b3507aa1cb394712969e1bcf409f</data>
