<node id="[LOCATION] Illinois">
  <data key="d0">[LOCATION] Illinois</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Illinois is a US state that served as the site for several verified events occurring between October 9 and October 27, 2025. During this period, the state was the location of protests and a specific operation known as Operation Midway Blitz. On October 25, 2025, weapons were deployed against protesters within the state, and an entity identified as EZ-17 was spotted during these incidents.

In response to these events, the legal system in Illinois intervened through federal judicial actions. A federal judge issued a ruling and a Temporary Restraining Order (TRO) restricting the use of LLW. Additionally, a judge ordered an injunction specifically regarding the use of force. Furthermore, Illinois is noted as a state where sanctuary policies are implemented.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1e8f0e5ea764556ba7aba3f8e5f4f3ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4333b56c71504cc5db99aeb9b9a3462&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-528d792138baa043a098b55be76593b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01b7723ae953bf130422ee19615d0a06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6a73f6c7351e7d12ae6e6090f3e8da9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c62092979a3f2ca6e48f697d46cc52ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf3b9eec46720c6dc296e97815683ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-033eff3da049499c50400c71bf5b6058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df00c56f336c81374b54c428982985f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58b830b38791cbe8b20eb03d5c9eb251</data>
  <data key="d4">raw/82e11604-60b7-410a-a0c3-4037e59b4796.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;raw/71151b33-9bc5-49eb-baf6-0d1494a8043d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;raw/ec2b6645-9847-4c98-8ae8-3e14ee0c97fc.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;raw/39b5e294-cadd-481b-9498-670b6e3121d4.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;raw/8c786cd1-aaf0-4b14-bff3-89560b40f36e.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1780570432</data>
</node>
